OL,3,GNEWSA'We had 10 minutes to decide
OL,4,Awhether to care for our disabled
OL,5,Agrandchild'
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite a heart attack, giving up his
OL,8,Fbusiness and having to move house,
OL,9,F65-year-old Alan says taking on the
OL,10,Ffull-time care of his disabled
OL,11,Fgrandchild is the best decision he has
OL,12,Fever made.
OL,14,FNine-year-old Ella, who has severe
OL,15,Flearning and physical disabilities, has
OL,16,Fbeen living with Alan and his wife
OL,17,FJulie since she was a baby.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
