OL,3,GNEWSA'We had 10 minutes to decide
OL,4,Awhether to care for our disabled
OL,5,Agrandchild'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer parents were unable to care for her
OL,8,Fand Alan says social services gave the
OL,9,Fcouple just 10 minutes to decide
OL,10,Fwhether to become Ella's "kinship
OL,11,Fcarers".
OL,13,FHe says: "A social worker said to us,
OL,14,F'this place closes in about 10 minutes,
OL,15,Fwe need to know if you are prepared to
OL,16,Ftake her on'. "
